{"version":1,"key":"card:49","content":{"id":49,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何不追踪某些文件？"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你还没有追踪这个文件，直接在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".gitignore","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 把他添加进去就行了"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# .gitignore\nprivate.key","language":"","uuid":"c93a9008-3dbb-48b6-befd-17e3521b4e55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果不小心追踪了某个不应该追踪的文件，比如密钥，这个时候只改 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".gitignore","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是不行的，需要使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"git rm","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"git rm -r --cached private.key","language":"shell","uuid":"b2cd20dc-304c-49a5-9877-803e731bf6cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后把 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"private.key","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".gitignore","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，然后重新提交就不会被追踪了。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Git/技巧","技巧/Git"],"createTime":1689000244636,"updateTime":1752924253836,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924253836}}